/**
 * Where each of the tool's questions prints, by question key.
 *
 * A key maps to one form question, or to several where the form asks the same
 * thing in two places. `null` means the answer steers the tool and has no field on
 * the form: it opens a section, or decides which form applies.
 *
 * Judgement calls, agreed with Irene on 2026-10-31:
 * - Dependence on the researcher prints under 2.5.1.
 * - Recruitment prints under 2.4.2; 2.4.3 and 2.4.4 are not asked.
 * - Incentives are asked under recruitment but the form asks them at 2.6.5.
 * - The keeper of the data feeds 2.8.2 and 2.8.3.
 */
